---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="GNED Hub | About">
	<main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-8 animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-bottom-4 duration-700">
		
		<div class="border-b border-white/10 pb-6">
			<h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-2">About This Hub</h1>
			<p class="text-slate-400">The purpose behind this digital space.</p>
		</div>

		<article class="prose prose-invert prose-slate max-w-none">
			<p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
				This website serves as a lightweight, lightning-fast repository for General Education subject materials. It was designed to eliminate the clutter of traditional Learning Management Systems, providing direct access to exactly what is needed for the semester.
			</p>
			
			<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mt-8 mb-4">Tech Stack</h3>
			<ul class="list-disc list-inside text-slate-300 space-y-2">
				<li>Built with <strong class="text-cyan-400 font-medium">Astro</strong> for static generation.</li>
				<li>Styled with <strong class="text-cyan-400 font-medium">Tailwind CSS</strong> for utility-first design.</li>
				<li>Hosted seamlessly with zero database overhead.</li>
			</ul>
		</article>

	</main>
</Layout>